{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ChS4T \u2013 AC Passenger Locomotive from the Era of Soviet Express Trains</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ChS4T is a modernized Czechoslovak electric locomotive designed for high-speed passenger service on AC-electrified mainlines across the former USSR. Based on the original ChS4 design, it was manufactured by the \u0160koda Works between 1980 and 1992.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the 1980s and 1990s, ChS4T locomotives were widely used to haul long-distance express trains. One notable area of operation was the Kyiv-Pasazhyrskyi depot, where these locomotives served until they were gradually replaced by the newer ChS8 series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of the model for ZDSimulator:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accurately recreated exterior with authentic modernization details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated driver's cab with fully functional instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic traction control, braking, and startup procedures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed electrical schematic recreated in full, with simulated fault scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic sounds of traction motors and auxiliary systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Functional lighting (headlights, yard lights, cab interior)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic physics tuned for high-speed passenger service</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ChS4T is perfect for historical routes and scenarios set in the 1980s\u20132000s era.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614830?t=1744917872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614830/f800dfb0141462d200bb8b7da48293855eba7a01/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614830/dd5c8f3e3bd1c